WEBVTT

00:26:26.663 --> 00:26:30.871
Most people are beginning to forge an
identity outside of their families

00:26:30.871 --> 00:26:34.621
and their communities and trying to figure
out their place in the world.

00:26:34.621 --> 00:26:38.871
And attitudes tend to be quite
malleable during this period.

00:26:39.163 --> 00:26:42.746
What's going on in the world, whether
economically, politically,

00:26:42.746 --> 00:26:48.913
culturally, tends to help shape those
attitudes in ways that mirror what's

00:26:48.913 --> 00:26:53.663
happening at that moment. And
after this critical period,

00:26:54.413 --> 00:26:57.329
attitudes don't tend to change that much.

00:26:58.079 --> 00:27:01.829
The indelible mark of the recession
doesn't just affect us individually.